{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows创建临时计划任务。对应需求：持久化。官方：Temporarily Scheduled Task Creation。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","index":["logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows创建临时计划任务","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows创建临时计划任务\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/security/threat-protection/auditing/event-4698"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"81ff45f8-f8c2-4e28-992e-5a0e8d98e0fe","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"type":"eql","query":"sequence by winlog.computer_name, winlog.event_data.TaskName with maxspan=5m\n   [iam where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.action == \"scheduled-task-created\" and not user.name : \"*$\"]\n   [iam where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.action == \"scheduled-task-deleted\" and not user.name : \"*$\"]\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1053","name":"Scheduled Task/Job","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1053.005","name":"Scheduled Task","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/005/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1053","name":"Scheduled Task/Job","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1053.005","name":"Scheduled Task","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/005/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":115,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
